sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant B as Bootstrapper
participant PC as ProcessControl
participant W as ProcessWorld
participant PCB as ProcessControlBlock
participant H as GAS hub
participant C as GASCore
participant S as Subsystems
B->>B: Bootstrap(), TagRegistry.Initialize, AttributeRegistry.Add
B->>PC: instantiate ProcessControlPrefab if there is no Instance
B->>PC: Bootstrap(deferStartState true)
PC->>W: ResetProcessControl(Ready), ApplyTickRate()
B->>PC: Register(GameRootPrefab).With(Default()).Run(out relay)
B->>PC: EnterStartState, BootstrapOverrides(), DeferredInit()
PC->>PC: CollectSceneProcesses(), by priority then depth
PC->>W: Register(p).With(Default()).In(this).Run()
Note over PC,W: The taker is the given world, else the Instance's World. The handler is the given one, else the packet's source, else GameRoot
W->>W: refuse AlreadyRegistered or ProcessControlClosed
W->>PCB: ProcessControlBlock.Generate makes the ProcessRelay
W->>W: HandlerSubscribeProcess(relay), SetProcess, ConfigureWrapper
W->>PCB: Initialize()
PCB->>H: SendProcessData(data, relay), WhenInitialize()
alt Mono hub
H->>C: new GASCore(this, Callbacks)
H->>C: Initialize(new RuntimeEntityIdentity(EntityData), affiliation)
else Runtime hub
Note over H,C: Its constructor already built and initialized the GASCore. WhenInitialize applies a registration AFFILIATION
end
C->>C: localData.Init(identity), ForgeEntities.Add(owner)
C->>S: Setup each subsystem, AttributeSystem.Setup(AttributeSet)
C->>C: InitializeEndOfFrame() makes ActionQueue, FrameSummary, AnalysisCache
C->>S: SetDeferredContext
C->>S: InitWorkers of the identity, the AttributeSet, the project's Every-Entity group
C->>S: LevelSystem.Register(AssetTag), AbilitySystem.Initialize(StartingAbilities)
C->>S: AttributeSystem.Initialize(), a CachedAttributeValue each, a zero pulse
C->>S: ItemSystem.Initialize(StartingItems), CompileGrantedTags()
C->>S: ActivateImmediateAbilities(), SpawnBody(), components Register
C-->>H: Callbacks.SystemInitialized()
W->>W: Callbacks.OnProcessRegistered
W->>PCB: the default transition for its lifecycle
Note over W,PCB: SelfTerminating, RunThenWait and Synchronous go to Running. RequiresControl waits for relay.Run()
